    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds okay, but honestly just automating tasks won't help my margins enough. if i really want to scale and keep the company lean, wouldn't the most logical move be to eventually replace some of these roles entirely with AI agents? it feels like a natural progression for a profitable tech company. what do you think about that approach?",
